<title>TUNISIA: Tunisian treasury raises 30.8 mln dinars at auctio.</title>
<headline>Tunisian treasury raises 30.8 mln dinars at auctio.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunisian Treasury raised 30.8 million dinars at its weekly auction of treasury bills dated July 22, and repaid maturing paper totalling 8.9 million dinars.</p>
<p>Here are details of the auction outcome:</p>
<p>    Maturity	  Amount	  Rate	Previous rate</p>
<p>    Two-year	17 million     7.0000    7.0000</p>
<p>    52-week	 13.75 million  6.9375    6.8750</p>
<p>The last time the treasury sold 52-week paper was on June 10. Banks bid for 246 million dinars for 52-week and two-year paper at between 6.9375 and 7.2500 percent. ($1 = 1.1384 dinar)</p>
<p>--Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
